  expect eq decompressed test f zstdtests  maxdecompressionratio passeswhenratiolargeenough size t korigsize   1024   1024 original   makecompressiblebuf korigsize compressed   compress original   
  assert ne compressed zd   std  make unique zstdstreamdecompressor 1000000 decompressed   zd- decompress compressed expect zd- haserror     
  expect ne decompressed expect eq decompressed- computechaindatalength    korigsize   
  
 
